{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058180/extras/a2c263f1d98a522fcc974902ba95ca46.avif?t=1762449005\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058180/extras_big/a2c263f1d98a522fcc974902ba95ca46.webp?t=1762449005 width=1560 height=878 /></span><br><br>They tried to crack you. You used it for hair gel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Punk Pack</strong> is a tribute to the loud, the proud, and the perpetually unwanted. It\u2019s not just fashion... it\u2019s a one-egg riot waiting to happen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With this pack you'll get access to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Egg-Spiked Mohawk:</strong> Gravity-defying spikes, held together with raw yolk and rage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Punk Coat:</strong> A tattered leather jacket over a screaming A-symbol tee. Ironically worn with total sincerity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Safety Nose Pin:</strong> Not a phase. Not safe for metal detectors. Possibly magnetic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Patched Gloves:</strong> Black gloves with bold red patches. For flipping the system, and flipping the bird.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warning:</strong> May cause side effects such as slouching, sneering, and unsolicited political opinions.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4058180?t=1762449005","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4058180?t=1762449005","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058180/feae3f80558bfbca2fe037e775fafa925360abf8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762449005","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058180/feae3f80558bfbca2fe